# ==============================================================================
# FLOW FRONTEND - VERCEL PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==============================================================================
# In Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
# Add the following variable:

# The public HTTPS API URL of your Render Backend Service (Part 2)
# Include the /api/v1 suffix:
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://flow-backend.onrender.com/api/v1

# Optional: Public App URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://flow-app.vercel.app

